<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Express + EJS + MongoDB</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Welcome to the Home Route</h1>
  <p>This is a Node.js + Express + EJS + MongoDB backend demo.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/create">/create</a> — create a sample user in MongoDB</li>
    <li><a href="/allUser">/allUser</a> — read all users</li>
    <li><a href="/delete">/delete</a> — delete the sample user</li>
    <li><a href="/checkCookie">/checkCookie</a> — log the request cookie</li>
    <li><a href="/deleteCookie">/deleteCookie</a> — clear the cookie</li>
    <li><a href="/checkSession">/checkSession</a> — check the session</li>
    <li><a href="/removeSession">/removeSession</a> — destroy the session</li>
  </ul>
